    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Drops, where peace, trees, and tranquility reign, an army of barrels turns this peaceful world into a nightmare. This is the story of our hero, the brave Drops, who is summoned for help by the village elder Drops, only to discover that his mission is fraught with danger. Drops must save this world. What a mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0641\u064a \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 &quot;\u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0631\u0627\u062a&quot;\u060c \u062d\u064a\u062b \u064a\u0633\u0648\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0633\u0644\u0627\u0645 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0623\u0634\u062c\u0627\u0631 \u0648\u0627\u0644\u0633\u0643\u064a\u0646\u0629\u060c \u064a\u062d\u0648\u0651\u0644 \u062c\u064a\u0634 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0628\u0631\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0644 \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0647\u0627\u062f\u0626 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0643\u0627\u0628\u0648\u0633. \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0642\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0637\u0644\u0646\u0627\u060c &quot;\u062f\u0631\u0648\u0628\u0633&quot; \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062c\u0627\u0639\u060c \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064a \u064a\u0633\u062a\u062f\u0639\u064a\u0647 \u062e\u0628\u064a\u0631 \u0642\u0631\u064a\u0629 &quot;\u062f\u0631\u0648\u0628\u0633&quot; \u0644\u0644\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u0629\u060c \u0644\u064a\u0643\u062a\u0634\u0641 \u0623\u0646 \u0645\u0647\u0645\u062a\u0647 \u0645\u062d\u0641\u0648\u0641\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u0627\u0637\u0631. \u0644\u0627 \u0628\u062f \u0623\u0646 \u064a\u0646\u0642\u0630 &quot;\u062f\u0631\u0648\u0628\u0633&quot; \u0647\u0630\u0627 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645. \u064a\u0627 \u0644\u0647\u0627 \u0645\u0646 \u0645\u0647\u0645\u0629!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the brave Drops, this journey will not only involve saving the world of Drops, but will also involve developing his own water molecules and discovering the maximum capabilities he can achieve on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0628\u0627\u0644\u0646\u0633\u0628\u0629 \u0644\u0640&quot;\u062f\u0631\u0648\u0628\u0633&quot; \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062c\u0627\u0639\u060c \u0644\u0646 \u062a\u0642\u062a\u0635\u0631 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0625\u0646\u0642\u0627\u0630 \u0639\u0627\u0644\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0637\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0641\u062d\u0633\u0628\u060c \u0628\u0644 \u0633\u062a\u0634\u0645\u0644 \u0623\u064a\u0636\u064b\u0627 \u062a\u0637\u0648\u064a\u0631 \u062c\u0632\u064a\u0626\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0647 \u0648\u0627\u0643\u062a\u0634\u0627\u0641 \u0627\u0644\u062d\u062f \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0642\u0635\u0649 \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u062f\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0647 \u062a\u062d\u0642\u064a\u0642\u0647\u0627 \u0641\u064a \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have options to evolve the water molecules of your brave Drops, between each stage, the enemy will evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0633\u064a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0644\u062f\u064a\u0643 \u062e\u064a\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a \u0644\u062a\u0637\u0648\u064a\u0631 \u062c\u0632\u064a\u0626\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0627\u0621 \u0627\u0644\u062e\u0627\u0635\u0629 \u0628\u0640\u00a0&quot;\u062f\u0631\u0648\u0628\u0633&quot; \u0627\u0644\u0634\u062c\u0627\u0639 \u060c \u0628\u064a\u0646 \u0643\u0644 \u0645\u0631\u062d\u0644\u0629\u060c \u0633\u0648\u0641 \u064a\u062a\u0637\u0648\u0631 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u062f\u0648.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure you will face some puzzles that you have to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0641\u064a \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u063a\u0627\u0645\u0631\u0629 \u0633\u0648\u0641 \u062a\u0648\u0627\u062c\u0647 \u0628\u0639\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0644\u063a\u0627\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u062a\u064a \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0643 \u062d\u0644\u0647\u0627.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission will inevitably be risky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u0633\u062a\u0643\u0648\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0647\u0645\u0629 \u0645\u062d\u0641\u0648\u0641\u0629 \u0628\u0627\u0644\u0645\u062e\u0627\u0637\u0631 \u062d\u062a\u0645\u0627.</p><p class=\"bb_p